- Fixed `fleetctl generate-gitops` writing two fleets to the same file when one name had `/ \ : * ? " < > |` where the other had a letter (for example, `Mac/Win` and `Macawin`), which made applying the export with `--delete-other-fleets` delete one of them. Each fleet now gets its own file, no fleet takes Unassigned's `unassigned.yml` or the `no-team.yml` that `fleetctl gitops` rejects, and `--fleet` exports the fleet with that name, in any case.
